B.aED={App:0,Design:1,Hardware:2,Ethics:3,"Mental Health":4,Web:5,Biotech:6,Push2Prod:7}
B.i9={text:0}
B.aCv=new A.bc(B.i9,["App Committee envisions to create tools to enhance the KTP experience. Our goal is to provide education on app development through project work. We develop front-end and back-end engineers, UI/UX designers, data scientists, user researchers, product managers, and more \u2014 no experience necessary!"],t.l)
B.aCt=new A.bc(B.i9,["Design Committee meets weekly and covers all things design and UX. Meetings typically consist of design education, teaching design tools, and the basics of the UX design & research process. It discusses design trends and preparing for UX recruiting through building case studies, portfolio development, and more. Design is open to all brothers, regardless of experience or background. We also work alongside App to help design our in-house KTP apps."],t.l)
B.aCw=new A.bc(B.i9,["The Maria Patni Hardware Committee provides brothers with hands-on experience in hard tech fundamentals through project-based learning. Our goal is to build practical skills in circuit design, embedded systems, sensors, motors, CAD, and mechanical prototyping while emphasizing real-world problem solving. Members collaborate to design, build, and test hardware projects ranging from integrated circuits to electromechanical systems. No prior experience is necessary."],t.l)
B.aCq=new A.bc(B.i9,["Ethics Committee aims to raise awareness of the moral/ethical problems brought about by technology. It provides brothers with a fun, laid-back environment to discuss topics ranging from Silicon Valley and AI bias to Elon Musk and Elizabeth Holmes. Anyone is welcome to participate in discussion \u2014 regardless of background knowledge!"],t.l)
B.aCr=new A.bc(B.i9,["Mental Health Committee focuses on education on improving one\u2019s own mental health. It facilitates discussions about mental health issues in student life/culture and brothers\u2019 mental health: topics such as imposter syndrome, the ways tech is being used to improve mental health, and interests beyond tech. Brothers can engage in weekly wellness and restorative activities, such as outdoor gatherings, meditation/reading/journaling sessions, discussions about setting personal goals, and more."],t.l)
B.aCu=new A.bc(B.i9,["Web Committee creates an environment where brothers can learn web-dev basics while working on a personal website. It offers workshops/tutorials on web development languages (HTML, CSS, Javascript, etc), useful frameworks/tools (Bootstrap, Git Pages, etc\u2026), and fundamentals (responsiveness, dynamic scaling, good UI/UX design)."],t.l)
B.aCs=new A.bc(B.i9,["Biotech Committee aims to shine a spotlight on the development of medical technology. Through weekly discussions, guest speakers, and more, it aims to get brothers thinking about applications of technology in ways that can literally change people's lives."],t.l)
B.aCx=new A.bc(B.i9,["Push2Prod Committee is a space for creatives and entrenepeurs alike to share, showcase, and build personal projects of theirs. The committee's goal is to connect brothers with the resources necessary to launch and run successful side projects, while providing them with a space to test and recieve feedback."],t.l)
B.N5=new A.bc(B.aED,[B.aCv,B.aCt,B.aCw,B.aCq,B.aCr,B.aCu,B.aCs,B.aCx],t.a1)
